sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Operator
    participant Sync as Catalogue synchronization
    participant Adapter as IGDB adapter / ACL
    participant IGDB as IGDB API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Telemetry

    Operator->>Sync: POST(from, to)
    Sync->>DB: Start synchronization_run(from, to)

    loop Pages until the inclusive interval is exhausted
        Sync->>Adapter: Release Games from..to after Game ID
        Adapter->>IGDB: Query release_dates with bounded page size
        IGDB-->>Adapter: Release-date rows ordered by Game ID
        Adapter-->>Sync: Deduplicated Game IDs for this page

        loop Each Game ID once
            Sync->>Adapter: Fetch current Game and all bounded Releases
            Adapter->>IGDB: Query Game and release_dates by Game ID
            IGDB-->>Adapter: Current provider aggregate
            Adapter-->>Sync: Normalized Game, Releases and cover
            Sync->>DB: Resolve Game external reference
            Sync->>DB: Create or reconcile Game and stable Release references atomically
            Note over Sync,DB: Invalid input preserves the Game's last valid state
        end
    end

    Sync->>DB: Complete synchronization_run with counters and outcome
    Sync->>Telemetry: Record bounded-label run and provider metrics
    Sync-->>Operator: Complete report for from..to

    Note over Operator,Telemetry: No mode, candidate queue or persistent checkpoint; IGDB never serves a public request
